cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use exovista in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "exovista: write PyVista meshes to ExodusII and read them back"
abstract: >-
  exovista writes PyVista meshes to the ExodusII finite-element format,
  with element blocks, side sets matched from a boundary surface, node sets,
  and static and time-varying node, element and global variables, and reads
  ExodusII files (including parallel decompositions) back into PyVista
  without loss of precision.
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-08"
license: BSD-2-Clause-Views
authors:
  - alias: Interfluo
  - name: Bijective Systems
repository-code: "https://github.com/bijective-systems-org/exovista"
url: "https://github.com/bijective-systems-org/exovista"
keywords:
  - exodus
  - exodusii
  - exodus-ii
  - pyvista
  - vtk
  - finite element
  - mesh
  - netcdf
  - side set
  - node set
  - seacas
  - simulation
references:
